  "final_message": "Done. `config/runtime.ini` now reads:\n\n```\n[primary]\ntimeout=35\n[shadow]\ntimeout=20\n```\n\nThe initial edit attempt failed with an `edit_conflict` because the ambiguous match (`timeout=20` alone appears in both `[primary]` and `[shadow]` sections) required a precondition guard — the tool correctly refused since it couldn't guarantee it would only touch the primary line. I recovered by scoping the `old`/`new` strings to include the `[primary]` section header alongside its timeout line, making the match unique, and the edit applied successfully. The `[shadow]` timeout remains untouched at 20, as intended.",
